# BAGEL WORLD — V2: City Life & Multiplayer

This repository now preserves the existing todo app while adding the foundation for BAGEL WORLD’s V2 social roleplay systems.

## Current repository state

- Existing app: `todo-app/` — a working todo app with localStorage persistence
- New V2 work: `client/` and `server/` — server browser + multiplayer foundation, kept modular and incremental

## What is implemented now

The project is being developed incrementally so the app remains runnable while each system is added.

### ✅ Completed foundation
- Client app scaffold for BAGEL WORLD V2
- Server API scaffold with static in-memory server records
- Servers page with:
  - list of public/private servers
  - server name, description, maximum players, online count, status
  - create server form
  - join server flow
  - invite code support
  - search/filter UI
- Admin/meta notes and roadmap documentation

### ⚠️ Planned next
- Persistent PostgreSQL-backed server records
- Player auth and secure session handling
- Personal housing system
- Smartphone UI and contact system
- Friend requests and friend list
- Economy and BAGEL Coins
- Housing permissions and furniture placement editor
- Real server-authoritative multiplayer processing
- HTTPS/WSS production deployment
- Database migrations and tests

